sport"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:23GoogleAnalyticsEncoding0aB12BatchEncoderV","text":"GoogleAnalyticsBatchEncoder","identifier":"doc:\/\/GoogleAnalyticsEncoding\/documentation\/GoogleAnalyticsEncoding\/GoogleAnalyticsBatchEncoder"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"name":"measurementID","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The web or data stream’s measurement ID, ","type":"text"},{"code":"G-","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" followed by letters and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"digits, from the stream’s details in Google Analytics’ Admin. Whitespace and newlines","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"around it are trimmed off.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"apiSecret","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"An API secret of the stream, from its Measurement Protocol API secrets in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Google Analytics’ Admin. Whitespace and newlines around it are trimmed off.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"region","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Where Google collects the data: "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GoogleAnalyticsEncoding\/documentation\/GoogleAnalyticsEncoding\/GoogleAnalyticsRegion\/global","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":", its default"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"endpoint, or "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GoogleAnalyticsEncoding\/documentation\/GoogleAnalyticsEncoding\/GoogleAnalyticsRegion\/eu","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"plan","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The tracking plan of every event the destination is given.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"transport","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"What sends each request."}]}]},{"name":"backoff","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"How long to wait before each new attempt at a request; 1 second, doubling up"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to 60 seconds, by default."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"clock","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The clock the waits are measured on."}]}]},{"name":"now","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The wall-clock time a batch is encoded at; the system’s clock by default.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Return Value","anchor":"return-value"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The destination.","type":"text"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The destination posts to the Measurement Protocol’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\/mp\/collect"},{"text":" endpoint of ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"region"},{"text":", with","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the measurement ID and API secret in its query, encoded by a ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GoogleAnalyticsEncoding\/documentation\/GoogleAnalyticsEncoding\/GoogleAnalyticsBatchEncoder","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"of ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"plan"},{"text":" within ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GoogleAnalyticsEncoding\/documentation\/GoogleAnalyticsEncoding\/GoogleAnalyticsBatchEncoder\/batchLimit","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" that leaves out each record","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"tracked more than 72 hours before, or more than 15 minutes after, the time ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"now"},{"text":" gives as a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"batch is encoded. It sends no trace context in its header fields. It retries no response, a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"5xx, 408 or 429, and drops and reports any other status. The Measurement Protocol answers","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"2xx to every request it receives, so a wrong measurement ID or API secret, or a request it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"can’t read, is answered 2xx with nothing stored: check the property’s Realtime report after","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"setting it up.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The API secret lets anyone holding it send events to the property, so this factory is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for a server, and must never be given a secret in an app. It is compiled for macOS and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Linux alone, so an app for iOS, iPadOS, tvOS, watchOS, visionOS or Mac Catalyst that calls"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it fails to compile. A Mac app (AppKit or SwiftUI) compiles it, but the factory refuses it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"at run time: it throws "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GoogleAnalyticsEncoding\/documentation\/GoogleAnalyticsEncoding\/GoogleAnalyticsSetupError\/appBundle","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" when the main bundle is an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".app"},{"type":"text","text":" or an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".appex"},{"type":"text","text":". To get an app’s events here, send them to a server of yours that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"makes this destination; see the module’s article for what that server does."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The secret is in the query of every request’s URL, so don’t log the destination, its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"requests or a transport’s URLs."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The encoder logs a notice for each event and property of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"plan"},{"type":"text","text":" named as Google Analytics"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"refuses, or keeps for itself, as every record of that event will be skipped"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/GoogleAnalyticsEncoding\/documentation\/GoogleAnalyticsEncoding\/GoogleAnalyticsEncodingError"},{"type":"text","text":")."}]},{"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"Throws","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GoogleAnalyticsEncoding\/documentation\/GoogleAnalyticsEncoding\/GoogleAnalyticsSetupError\/appBundle","isActive":true},{"text":" in an app or an app extension,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GoogleAnalyticsEncoding\/documentation\/GoogleAnalyticsEncoding\/GoogleAnalyticsSetupError\/emptyMeasurementID","isActive":true},{"text":" for a measurement ID that is empty or only","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"whitespace, ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GoogleAnalyticsEncoding\/documentation\/GoogleAnalyticsEncoding\/GoogleAnalyticsSetupError\/malformedMeasurementID","isActive":true},{"text":" for one that isn’t ","type":"text"},{"code":"G-","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"followed by uppercase ASCII letters and digits, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GoogleAnalyticsEncoding\/documentation\/GoogleAnalyticsEncoding\/GoogleAnalyticsSetupError\/emptyAPISecret","isActive":true},{"text":" for a secret that is empty or only","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"whitespace.","type":"text"}]}]}]}],"metadata":{"externalID":"s:16HTTPDestinations15HTTPDestinationV23GoogleAnalyticsEncodingAD0cD12BatchEncoderVRs_rlE06googleD013measuremen